{
  "dom_id": "step-38160",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Finding Part of a Joint CDF from a Joint PDF",
  "problem": "Let $X$ and $Y$ be continuous random variables with the joint probability density function \n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14274884/assets/ef996369f785405f40f576aafc3b0ec3a5045a38ee36636908c3ea91f976d94f.svg) \nFind the expression for the corresponding joint CDF when $0 \\leq x \\leq 2$ and $y\\gt 1.$",
  "worked_solution": "If $X$ and $Y$ are continuous random variables with the joint probability density function $f(x,y),$ then the corresponding joint CDF is given by\n\n$$\nF(x,y) = P(X \\leq x, Y \\leq y) = \\int_{-\\infty}^y \\int_{-\\infty}^x f(u,v)\\; \\textrm{d}u \\, \\textrm{d}v.\n$$\n\nLet's draw the region $D$ in the $uv$-plane where the function $f(u,v)$ is nonzero. Let's also consider a point $(x,y)$ where $0 \\leq x \\leq 2,\\;  y \\gt 1$ and a region $\\Delta$ that lies below and to the left of this point.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14274884/assets/a7b43fd1a1622f406b7679d9f0f34552e046b9bc94b75a3504677f30b347d283.png)\n\nFor the purposes of computation, we're only interested in the region inside $\\Delta$ where $f(x,y)$ is nonzero. This is given by\n\n$$\nD \\cap \\Delta =\\left\\{ (u,v) \\: : \\: 0 \\leq u \\leq x, \\: 0 \\leq v \\leq 1 \\right\\}.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{y}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{x}f(u,v)\\,\\text{d}u\\,\\text{d}v & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{x}\\frac{1}{3}(u+v)\\,\\text{d}u\\,\\text{d}v \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}{\\int }_{0}^{1}{[\\frac{{u}^{2}}{2}+uv]}_{u=0}^{u=x}\\,\\text{d}v \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}{\\int }_{0}^{1}[\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}+xv]\\text{d}v \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}{[\\frac{{x}^{2}v}{2}+\\frac{x{v}^{2}}{2}]}_{v=0}^{v=1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}[\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}+\\frac{x}{2}-0] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}({x}^{2}+x).\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
